.Dd 2025-09-30
.Dt OSSL_IETF_ATTR_SYNTAX_PRINT 3ossl
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm OSSL_IETF_ATTR_SYNTAX_print
.Nd OSSL_IETF_ATTR_SYNTAX printing
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In openssl/x509_acert.h
.Ft int
.Fo OSSL_IETF_ATTR_SYNTAX_print
.Fa "BIO *bp"
.Fa "OSSL_IETF_ATTR_SYNTAX *a"
.Fa "int indent"
.Fc
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Fn OSSL_IETF_ATTR_SYNTAX_print
prints a human readable version of
.Fa a
to BIO
.Fa bp .
Each line of the output is indented by
.Fa indent
spaces.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
.Fn OSSL_IETF_ATTR_SYNTAX_print
return 1 on success or 0 on failure.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr ASN1_STRING_print_ex 3
.Sh HISTORY
.Fn OSSL_IETF_ATTR_SYNTAX_print
was added in OpenSSL 3.4.
